    "importantNotices": {
      "title": "Important Notices",
      "content": "We would like to inform you that if the product is inspected and you wish to return it, a delivery fee will be charged. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n\n- Please note that the sizes displayed in the app match the commonly used sizes in the local market.\n\n- If you would like to add your store to our app, please fill in the required information in the 'Become a Seller' section on the Account page.\n\n- If you are interested in becoming one of Mahalat’s delivery captains, please enter your phone number in the Help section, and we will contact you immediately.\n\nAbout Mahalat App:\nMahalat is an app that allows you to choose products from your favorite local stores, and our drivers will deliver them to your location faster than you expect."
